# EA app (formerly Origin). Environment from frankea/Whisky's LauncherPresets.swift
# (GPL-3.0-or-later). Its UI is Chromium-based like Steam's, so it goes on DXVK here.
# Chromium's NVIDIA probe would load D3DMetal's nvapi into the DXVK processes: off there.
# The app lives in <version>\EA Desktop behind a Windows link EA Desktop\EA Desktop, which wine
# keeps as "EA Desktop?" with the target in an attribute: nothing may be put in its place, EA
# reads the link to tell its current version from old ones and deletes the rest.
# EACefSubProcess.exe draws the window.
name EA app
kind launcher
status experimental
symbol a.circle
about Лаунчер EA (бывший Origin). Интерфейс через DXVK. Ставится и открывает вход (10/10/2026), вход и игры ещё не проверены.
bottle ea
installer https://origin-a.akamaihd.net/EA-Desktop-Client-Download/installer-releases/EAappInstaller.exe /quiet
exe C:\Program Files\Electronic Arts\EA Desktop\EA Desktop\EADesktop.exe
env LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8
env LANG=en_US.UTF-8
env CEF_DISABLE_SANDBOX=1
dxvk EADesktop.exe
dxvk EABackgroundService.exe
dxvk EACefSubProcess.exe
dll EADesktop.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
dll EABackgroundService.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
dll EACefSubProcess.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
